    Redraw flora as real pixel art on the background's own grid
    
    The plants read as stickers because they were smooth vector shapes over
    chunky pixel art. Three causes: className="pixelated" is a no-op on
    inline SVG (image-rendering only affects rasters), the shapes were
    perfect circles and beziers, and soft gaussian drop-shadows gave them a
    cut-out edge pixel art never has.
    
    Redraw every plant as integer rects with shapeRendering="crispEdges",
    using colours sampled straight out of loading_bg.jpg, lit dark at the
    root to bright at the tip. Component names and props are unchanged, so
    all existing call sites keep working.
    
